# arithor: source arrays [0,1,0,0,1] and [0,0,0,1,0], search comparison value
# GOAL: Find a value equal to at least one component of every given pair.
# Source: https://github.com/hakank/hakank/blob/2823c48d3d2e5d86acb3b8e6951172499c8946b0/minizinc/arith_or.mzn
# Generated by scripts/generate_hakank_globals.py; all decisions remain holes.
